    usage = "AGENT [--dry-run] [--key K]", help = "take back an agent's last edit, whole. The app does it, on the level open there; from the folder's files it says which edit and why it can't. A cloud agent's last change is taken back on your account, the level put as it was before it, while nothing has changed it since"},
